                                                   444 ***********************************************************************
                                                   445 *        Issue HERCULES MESSAGE
                                                   446 *              R0 = length of message
                                                   447 *              R1 = message address
                                                   448 *              R2 = return address
                                                   449 ***********************************************************************

00002598  4900 8688                     00002688   451 MSG      CH    R0,=H'0'            Do we even HAVE a message?
0000259C  07D2                                     452          BNHR  R2                  No, ignore

0000259E  9002 85D4                     000025D4   454          STM   R0,R2,MSGSAVE       Save registers

000025A2  4900 868A                     0000268A   456          CH    R0,=AL2(L'MSGMSG)   Message length within limits?
000025A6  47D0 85AE                     000025AE   457          BNH   MSGOK               Yes, continue
000025AA  4100 005F                     0000005F   458          LA    R0,L'MSGMSG         No, set to maximum

000025AE  1820                                     460 MSGOK    LR    R2,R0               Copy length to work register
000025B0  0620                                     461          BCTR  R2,0                Minus-1 for execute
000025B2  4420 85E0                     000025E0   462          EX    R2,MSGMVC           Copy message to O/P buffer

